# Security headers for all responses (Cloudflare Pages honours this file).
#
# The Content-Security-Policy is NOT here. It lives in svelte.config.js under
# kit.csp, because SvelteKit emits a per-request inline hydration script that
# cannot be hashed from outside the framework; a policy written here without it
# blocks hydration on every page. SvelteKit hashes that script and emits the
# header itself. Setting a second CSP here would intersect with that one and
# break the site, so do not add one back.
/*
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), microphone=(), camera=()
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
